### =========================================================
### SERVICE RBAC — REST Client Test File
### Extension VSCode yang dibutuhkan: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Cara pakai: klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok, urut dari atas ke bawah.
### Setelah login, copy accessToken ke variable @token di bawah supaya request
### yang butuh auth otomatis terpakai.
### =========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/rbac
@apiRoot = http://localhost:5001
@token = ISI_ACCESS_TOKEN_SETELAH_LOGIN
@refreshToken = ISI_REFRESH_TOKEN_SETELAH_LOGIN

### -------------------------------------------------------
### HEALTH CHECK
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Cek service hidup (health ada di root, bukan di bawah /rbac)
GET {{apiRoot}}/health


### -------------------------------------------------------
### AUTH — Register, Login, Refresh, Logout, Change Password
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Register applicant baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teguh Bagas Test",
  "email": "teguh@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Register dengan email yang sudah ada (harus 409, bukan 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplikat Test",
  "email": "teguh@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login (isi password sesuai yang muncul di console log mock email)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@beasiswa.test",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}


### Login dengan password salah (harus 401 pesan generik)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@beasiswa.test",
  "password": "passwordSalah123"
}


### Ambil profil sendiri (butuh token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### Ganti password (butuh token, akan revoke semua refresh token lain)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "PASSWORD_LAMA",
  "newPassword": "PasswordBaruAman123!"
}


### Logout (revoke refresh token yang dipakai)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------
### USERS — Admin only (login sebagai admin dulu, isi @token dengan token admin)
### -------------------------------------------------------

### List semua user (pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Admin membuat user internal baru (verifikator/lembaga_seleksi/admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Verifikator Satu",
  "email": "[email protected]",
  "roleId": 2
}


### Detail user tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Update user (nama, role, status aktif)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Verifikator Satu Updated",
  "roleId": 2,
  "isActive": true
}


### Nonaktifkan user (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Test proteksi: admin coba nonaktifkan akun sendiri (harus ditolak 400)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Test proteksi role: coba akses endpoint admin pakai token applicant (harus 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer ISI_TOKEN_APPLICANT_DISINI


### -------------------------------------------------------
### ROLES — Admin only
### -------------------------------------------------------

### List semua role
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buat role baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "reviewer_khusus"
}


### Update nama role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/roles/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "reviewer_khusus_updated"
}


### Hapus role (harus gagal 400 kalau masih dipakai user)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roles/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------
### MENUS — Admin only
### -------------------------------------------------------

### List semua menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buat menu baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Data Master Beasiswa",
  "path": "/admin/data-master/beasiswa"
}


### Update menu
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menus/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Data Master Beasiswa Updated",
  "path": "/admin/data-master/beasiswa"
}


### Hapus menu (harus gagal 400 kalau masih dipakai di role_menu_access)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/menus/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------
### ROLE-MENU ACCESS — Admin only
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Lihat akses menu untuk role tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles/2/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Set/replace akses menu untuk role tertentu (transaction: hapus lama, insert baru)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/roles/2/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "menuId": 1, "canRead": true, "canWrite": false },
  { "menuId": 2, "canRead": true, "canWrite": true }
]


### Test validasi: kirim menuId yang tidak exist (harus 400, bukan crash)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/roles/2/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "menuId": 9999, "canRead": true, "canWrite": false }
]
